Name: flex

    flex 2.7.10 with no Fil-C patch: the upstream release tarball ships a ready-made configure and optfil builds it pristine (CC=/opt/fil/bin/filcc ./configure --prefix=/opt/fil --disable-static).  Replaces the pizlix/flex-2.6.4.tar.gz copy optfil used to build directly; that pizlix tarball stays for the prelc yolo toolchain stage.
